        "workup_and_crystallization": "filtered; blue hexagonal crystals by slow evaporation over 2 weeks",
        "yield": null
      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Antiferromagnetic Cu–Gd/Gd–Gd exchange; χMT remains nearly constant to ~40 K then drops. Magnetocaloric −ΔSm = 26.9 J kg−1 K−1 at 3 K and 7 T (~66% of the non-interacting 20.8R entropy). No SMM out-of-phase ac signal above 2 K for anisotropic analogues of the family.",
        "measurements": [
